OL,3,GNEWSAPupils asked to back Town of
OL,4,ACulture 2028 bid
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchool pupils are backing Corby's bid
OL,7,Fto become the UK's first Town of
OL,8,FCulture in 2028 by sharing stories of
OL,9,Fwhere they live.
OL,11,FThe town-wide initiative, where
OL,12,Fyoungsters and residents write their
OL,13,Ftales on a postcard, was launched last
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FCorby is among a shortlist of 15 towns
OL,17,Fbidding for the title, which comes with
OL,18,Fa #3m prize.
OL,20,FTown council leader Simon Rielly said
OL,21,Fthe area had "a great chance of
OL,22,Fsuccess".
